repas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"Yr2SUyNncEwy-LgE-eU7kQ","review_id":"b18n_UKIO1eI0g_CyGFu7g","date":"2021-02-07T22:16:26","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9270192980766296,"text_excerpt":"The CRAWFISH!!!!! That's it! That's the review! This new gem in the city is guaranteed to be busy on a regular. Stopped by on Super Bowl Sunday with the kids for a quick snack and they did not disappoint. The shrimp were well seasoned, juicy, and easy to peel. Not to mention they were boiled to perfection! The sausage was fresh with just the right bit of spice. We also tried the \"Soul Roll\" which was AMAZING! Tender well seasoned bbq pork mixed with succulent Mac and cheese wrapped in a roll and then fried.... YES PLEASE! The crawfish! Perfectly seasoned, a little spice but not too much, and reasonably priced today at $5.49/lb. definitely worth it!"},{"business_id":"Yr2SUyNncEwy-LgE-eU7kQ","review_id":"nEe4Fo62XYhNy-rn127yXg","date":"2021-06-09T06:45:05","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.914058268070221,"text_excerpt":"I see why their called the crawfish king...their crawfish is good, as well their other seafood fixxings. Now. I tried their boudin ball and it was good. I only tried their seafood but I wanna try their bbq food next."},{"business_id":"Yr2SUyNncEwy-LgE-eU7kQ","review_id":"wj9xRrwYF1EcZ0QvUvFkRg","date":"2021-01-23T23:16:28","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.913510262966156,"text_excerpt":"I made it!!! I made it!!! I made it!!!! Knowing me is knowing I AM A CONNOISSEUR of boiled crawfish... I am the judge, jury & prosecutor!!!! I BE KNOWING about the crawfish. This establishment is new to being a brick and mortar business. However, the crawfish king has been around for a while catering private parties, being a the crawfish fest & serving crawfish from the food truck. So glad that he's finally in a permanent location where is easier to find him and I can get my crawfish on. To note: crawfish is not the only thing that they serve. They have a full menu barbecue and Boudin and a whole bunch of other stuff. But for me and my house all we are concerned about is the crawfish and ..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"Yr2SUyNncEwy-LgE-eU7kQ","photo_id":"1V4r564t6q-zzkUabzFvOA","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/1V4r564t6q-zzkUabzFvOA.jpg","visual_representativeness":1.0}]},"notebook_case":null}
